Open Core
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

FDOS follows an Open Core architecture (see docs/constitution.md).

This repository contains the public core: the engineering platform, canonical
models, ledger, SDKs, APIs, documentation, knowledge graph and testing
infrastructure. It is licensed under Apache-2.0.

Private components — authenticated providers, browser connectors,
institution-specific plugins, provider automation and private parsers — live in
separate repositories and are NOT covered by this license. They depend on this
repository exclusively through published, versioned contract modules.
